{
    "title": "DAT One",
    "description": "DAT One is the single source for all things freight, combining 15 apps into one fast and easy set of tools to book loads and find truck services including fuel stops, truck parking, rest stops and much more.\r\n\r\nFind higher-paying loads on the largest and most recommended load board network in North America. Nearly 1.4 million loads are posted daily, with 440,000 loads available on DAT One first or nowhere else.\r\n\r\nIn addition to finding loads and truck amenities, you\u2019ll have access to the most accurate market rate data, tools, and insights to forecast and negotiate from a position of strength. Get the load you want at the price you need with the DAT One app for truckers.\r\n\r\nFAST AND EASY-TO-USE FEATURES\r\n- Find loads no matter where you are. Over 500 million loads are posted on DAT One annually\r\n- Easily find truck stops, service stations, and rest areas for more strategic trip planning\r\n- Quickly view average rates paid on 68,000 lanes with the Quick Rate Lookup tool\r\n\r\nEFFICIENT TOOLS TO GROW YOUR BUSINESS\r\n- Save up to $1,000 in monthly fuel costs with the new fuel highlight feature\r\n- Post your truck with a starting rate to have fewer, more productive phone calls with brokers\r\n- Compare offer rates to average market rates, based on $137 billion in actual transactions\r\n- Gain access to LaneMakers, Trendlines, Market Conditions and other tools to maximize your profitability\r\n\r\nTRUCKING\u2019S MOST TRUSTED NETWORK\r\n- More factorable loads than any other load board\r\n- See credit scores and company reviews for brokers to book higher-quality loads\r\n- Increase your cash flow and get paid within 24 hours with factoring options",
    "descriptionHTML": "DAT One is the single source for all things freight, combining 15 apps into one fast and easy set of tools to book loads and find truck services including fuel stops, truck parking, rest stops and much more.<br><br>Find higher-paying loads on the largest and most recommended load board network in North America. Nearly 1.4 million loads are posted daily, with 440,000 loads available on DAT One first or nowhere else.<br><br>In addition to finding loads and truck amenities, you\u2019ll have access to the most accurate market rate data, tools, and insights to forecast and negotiate from a position of strength. Get the load you want at the price you need with the DAT One app for truckers.<br><br>FAST AND EASY-TO-USE FEATURES<br>- Find loads no matter where you are. Over 500 million loads are posted on DAT One annually<br>- Easily find truck stops, service stations, and rest areas for more strategic trip planning<br>- Quickly view average rates paid on 68,000 lanes with the Quick Rate Lookup tool<br><br>EFFICIENT TOOLS TO GROW YOUR BUSINESS<br>- Save up to $1,000 in monthly fuel costs with the new fuel highlight feature<br>- Post your truck with a starting rate to have fewer, more productive phone calls with brokers<br>- Compare offer rates to average market rates, based on $137 billion in actual transactions<br>- Gain access to LaneMakers, Trendlines, Market Conditions and other tools to maximize your profitability<br><br>TRUCKING\u2019S MOST TRUSTED NETWORK<br>- More factorable loads than any other load board<br>- See credit scores and company reviews for brokers to book higher-quality loads<br>- Increase your cash flow and get paid within 24 hours with factoring options",
